# No PR without verification

Do not `git push`, `gh pr create`, or move a ticket to review until the change is verified when any repro path exists.

1. Trace the runtime path your edit affects.
2. Reproduce or anchor the symptom.
3. Verify the fix (local, staging, or tests).
4. Save evidence under `.cursor/temp/<issue-key>/qa-screenshots/` when UI/runtime changed.

Report environment, steps, and evidence paths in chat before push.

Skip only when repro is genuinely blocked — say why; do not use review status as a placeholder.
